{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55635","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 三十三 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 三十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万象从来一径通，但缘分别便西东。\n遗簪只爲情难尽，泣路方知意无穷。\n偃仰不抛青嶂里，往来多在白云中。\n平生分野应难比，涧饮林栖得古风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55635.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55635","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}